  "description": "Sign in with vo.cab from a .NET MAUI app: AddVocab() wires the authorization code flow with PKCE through the system browser (WebAuthenticator) back to your app's private-use redirect, keeps the tokens in SecureStorage, refreshes them before they expire (one refresh however many callers race) and signs out by revoking the refresh token. Comes with a ready VocabClient for the network API.",
